    "policy": "live_money_canary_consideration_requires external alerting, immutable evidence, source/security hygiene, auth continuity, storage disaster recovery, blackstart recovery, broker/paper reconciliation, SLOs, telemetry redaction, microscopic canary cap, and a read-only live firewall"
